{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670923305181301046","title":"大模型推理引擎开发工程师（高性能算子）","description":"1、通过编译优化、模型并行优化、图融合、高性能算子开发、低精度计算、Memory复用、Cache优化、高并发服务请求优化等技术，打造业界领先的高性能训推引擎；\n2、设计和开发高性能算子库，研究最新的GPU计算技术和优化方法，以充分利用GPU的并行计算能力，支持大模型推理优化和部署。","requirement":"1、硕士及以上学历，计算机、软件工程、数学等相关专业，具备扎实计算机理论基础和丰富编程经验，在深度学习领域有深入研究与实践；\n2、精通 Python，熟练掌握至少一种深度学习框架（如 PyTorch），理解深度学习和transformer系列算法，有丰富模型开发与调优经验，能独立搭建复杂模型并优化性能；\n3、熟悉主流的并行编程以及性能优化技术，熟悉CUDA和TensorCore编程，有相关高性能优化经验(nsys/ncu)优先；\n4、熟悉flashattention，TransformerEngine, flashinfer等算子库， 有使用triton/tilelang等做高性能算子开发经验优先。","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786026092047,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178759516879405165","name":"软件研发类","en_name":"Software R\u0026D","i18n_name":"软件研发类"},"job_id":"7670923305181120822","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","e